    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Yo-tham",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë took Yo-tham ruëc, tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run wäl bäkɛl. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱, Yɛ-ru-ca nya Dha-dok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni cuŋ nhiam Kuɔth Nhial ce̱tnikɛ tëë diaal tëë ci gua̱n ni U-dhi-yaa kɛ la̱t. Kuɛ la ɣöö /kenɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth ce̱tkɛ gua̱n. Kä cu naath ŋot kɛ mi la̱tkɛ ni ti jiäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thi̱i̱k luaak Kuɔth Nhial in te Nhial la̱t, kä cuɛ la̱t mi di̱i̱t lät kä päny O-pɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wi̱i̱ la̱t wi̱i̱ni pa̱a̱m Juda, kä cuɛ ti̱ec kɛ cuut la̱t rɛy ruɔ̱ɔ̱p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Am-on, kä cuɛ kɛ joc kä cu ji̱ Am-on ɛ ka̱m ciɛk in bo̱r mi tekɛ ki̱luni ti kuɔ̱r kɛl kɛ bathdɔɔri wäl cuali nuɔ̱p, kɛ cuali bɛɛl ti bathdɔɔri wäl ɛn runä nɔmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cuɛ buɔ̱m, kɛ ɣöö cɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dup Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätnikɛ diaal gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë tookɛ kuäär tekɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec. Kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run wäl bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-tham li̱w, cukɛ jɛ kony därwec Dee-bid. Kä cu gatdɛ ni A-ɣadh ruëc kɛ gua̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
